# Rendered media IS versioned from batch-02 onwards: automated publishing (Make ->
# Facebook Page + Instagram) needs a public URL for every image and video, and the
# raw.githubusercontent.com URL of this repo is that URL. Keep the repo public or
# the links stop resolving.

# Render temporaries: reel.py writes a .wav next to the mp4 and deletes it on success.
# A leftover one is an interrupted render, never a deliverable.
*.wav
